<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-WORLD XI BEAT RUSSIA 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD XI BEAT RUSSIA 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A World XI beat Russia 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a match on Monday to mark the centenary of</p>
<p>Russian soccer.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Youri Djorkaeff 52, Julen Guerrero 78</p>
<p>Attendance: 55,000</p>
</text>
